From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Crewship <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 03:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bin): queue needs-decision lines and hand each to one
 crewmate that texts the owner

A needs-decision or blocked line from any mate now lands as one durable record
under state/decision-queue/ (config/decision-queue turns it on). The watcher
enqueues it and keeps it out of chat. fm-decision-queue.sh imports a home's open
decisions (--dry-run counts first), spawns at most three crewmates, one per
record, to text the owner and relay the answer with fm-send.sh --resolve-key,
and batches the overflow into one digest text. A second mate's done line sends
one rate-limited progress text.
